<h1 class="h1 text-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size:28px; line-height:36px; font-weight:700; color:#1B1A22;">New {{.Payload.type}} uploaded</h1>
<p class="text-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:26px; color:#1B1A22;">Hi {{.Recipient.Name}},</p>
<p class="text-muted" style="margin:0 0 24px 0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:26px; color:#4A4757;">&ldquo;{{.Payload.title}}&rdquo; was added to {{.Payload.module_title}}.</p>
<p class="text-muted" style="margin:0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:26px; color:#4A4757;">{{.Payload.description}}</p>
